  "tags": [
    "Reanimator",
    "Self-mill",
    "Combat damage",
    "Graveyard"
  ],
  "strategy": "Terra, Herald of Hope mills two at the beginning of each of your combats, flies in, and pays {2} on combat damage to put a creature card with power 3 or less back onto the battlefield tapped. The deck fills its own graveyard to feed that: Siegfried, Famed Swordsman, Stitcher's Supplier, Locke, Treasure Hunter and Ruin Grinder mill or refill, and The Warring Triad wakes once eight cards are there. Then it brings creatures back: General Leo Cristophe, Sun Titan, Priest of Fell Rites, Phoenix Down, Reanimate and Stitch Together return the small ones, Sepulchral Primordial and Rise of the Dark Realms take the table's, Celes, Rune Knight puts a +1/+1 counter on the team when creatures arrive from a graveyard, and Cyan, Vengeful Samurai grows whenever creature cards leave yours. Shadow, Mysterious Assassin, The Falcon, Airship Restored and Setzer, Wandering Gambler turn combat damage into cards, recursion and Treasure, and Pitiless Plunderer and Morbid Opportunist pay for the creatures that die on the way.",
